                     <content styleCode="italics">Active ingredients (in each caplet)<br/>
                     </content>
                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Acetaminophen 325 mg<br/>Chlorpheniramine maleate 2 mg<br/>Dextromethorphan HBr 10 mg</paragraph>
               </text>
